Doc, look at me, a doc told you I'd be up and around in no time, and am I?

00:40:57.460 --> 00:40:58.240
You seen my sticks?

00:40:59.590 --> 00:40:59.970
See my...

00:41:00.720 --> 00:41:03.490
You know what I'm gonna get for this little dog?

00:41:04.120 --> 00:41:06.140
A little raincoat, like for when it rains.

00:41:06.930 --> 00:41:09.770
Plaid, maybe. Or maybe all yellow, huh?

00:41:10.820 --> 00:41:11.900
Where are my drumsticks, Zosh?

00:41:12.700 --> 00:41:15.720
How'd they get up here?

00:41:17.030 --> 00:41:17.810
Zosh, didn't you?

00:41:18.410 --> 00:41:19.870
Zosh, I'd never keep them way up here.

00:41:20.580 --> 00:41:22.060
Drink it all up, didn't you?

00:41:22.770 --> 00:41:23.130
Zosh!

00:41:30.570 --> 00:41:34.880
I put him there. I stood right up, I walked right over and I put him there, all right?

00:41:35.020 --> 00:41:35.840
No, no kidding. I didn't...

00:41:35.840 --> 00:41:39.660
Maybe Vi, when she was straightening up for me. I don't know. Stop picking on me!

00:41:51.080 --> 00:41:53.120
You can't keep stoning yourself up, girl.

00:41:54.710 --> 00:41:58.010
There must be a million drummers play better than you do who can't get jobs.

00:41:58.660 --> 00:41:59.960
Just remember that and you're gonna...

00:42:00.000 --> 00:42:00.720
You'll feel better.

00:42:02.160 --> 00:42:02.840
Yeah, sure, I will.

