Beer bloats, Josh, when you can't exercise.

00:43:11.200 --> 00:43:11.900
Here, pick a card.

00:43:12.880 --> 00:43:13.760
Everything's no good for me.

00:43:14.250 --> 00:43:16.510
I'm only 25, and it's like I'm a whole lady already.

00:43:17.490 --> 00:43:18.970
Is it my fault I can't exercise?

00:43:19.290 --> 00:43:22.370
You want to pick a card, or don't you want to pick a card?

00:43:22.530 --> 00:43:24.150
No, I don't want to pick a card.

00:43:24.880 --> 00:43:27.300
All I want is just a little...

00:43:29.300 --> 00:43:29.600
What, sir?

00:43:30.640 --> 00:43:36.410
Just a little, a little beer, a little, a little anything.

00:43:37.460 --> 00:43:40.060
I can't dance no more, I can't swim, I can't even drink beer.

00:43:41.150 --> 00:43:42.610
I don't even know what kinds I got anymore.

00:43:45.010 --> 00:43:46.630
What other kinds I got these days, Frankie?

00:43:50.520 --> 00:43:51.440
Pretend like I ain't here.

00:43:52.280 --> 00:43:54.440
But you're all the time wishing anyway that I got killed that night.

00:43:55.410 --> 00:43:56.590
I don't wish any such thing.

00:43:59.370 --> 00:43:59.870
Don't talk again.

00:44:00.000 --> 00:44:05.320
mad if i say anything you bite my head off i don't know whether i'm coming or going anymore zosh

00:44:06.400 --> 00:44:13.710
i told you it gives me headaches well i gotta practice sometimes zosh

00:44:13.710 --> 00:44:19.870
the job comes along i want to be ready job the job take them down to your girlfriend if you gotta

00:44:19.870 --> 00:44:20.290
I practice.

00:44:31.210 --> 00:44:33.470
Take them down and give her the headache.

