00:50:18.860 --> 00:50:22.680
Here, what we owe.

00:50:23.080 --> 00:50:24.940
Frankie, why says can she trust me?

00:50:25.060 --> 00:50:27.760
Tell her, tell her, Frankie, what honest hustler I am.

00:50:28.820 --> 00:50:29.160
Frankie.

00:50:31.370 --> 00:50:33.310
I guess maybe you could drop in once in a while.

00:50:36.900 --> 00:50:38.380
Thanks, Marleo.

00:50:44.960 --> 00:50:45.500
Good night.

00:52:02.170 --> 00:52:08.360
Real nice.

