I did it with Perdido a little while ago.

00:52:16.350 --> 00:52:16.590
Good, huh?

00:52:18.200 --> 00:52:19.200
The neighbors liked it, too.

00:52:21.240 --> 00:52:21.940
They're big with the neighbors.

00:52:23.980 --> 00:52:26.060
And on the pipes, let me know how much they appreciate.

00:52:28.900 --> 00:52:29.460
My head, though.

00:52:30.640 --> 00:52:31.740
I can't play drums.

00:52:32.710 --> 00:52:34.790
5 a.m. and you'll see what goes to your head.

00:52:35.560 --> 00:52:41.760
Put me a smile and I'll give you my autograph.

00:52:43.140 --> 00:52:45.520
You won't have to fight your way through the Bobby Soxes to get to me.

00:52:46.240 --> 00:52:48.480
I bet those Bobby Soxes go for you, Thap.

00:52:49.080 --> 00:52:59.140
Ah, very nice way.

00:53:00.190 --> 00:53:01.390
I've been feeling good all night.

00:53:04.560 --> 00:53:05.820
I joined the Musicians' Union today.

00:53:06.250 --> 00:53:07.290
Did Shviefka learn you the money?

00:53:08.310 --> 00:53:08.550
Him?

00:53:10.660 --> 00:53:11.000
Who did?

00:53:11.420 --> 00:53:14.250
Nobody. I'm going to hop the drums.

00:53:15.090 --> 00:53:15.910
Oh, Frankie, no.

00:53:16.740 --> 00:53:17.880
I've got it figured out pretty good.

00:53:18.490 --> 00:53:20.950
When I get a job, I'll take an advance and get the drums out again.

00:53:21.200 --> 00:53:22.560
In the meantime, I'll use a practice pad.

00:53:23.660 --> 00:53:24.740
You should have asked Shviefka.

00:53:26.260 --> 00:53:26.940
I haven't even seen him.

00:53:28.110 --> 00:53:28.930
You didn't go to work?

00:53:30.000 --> 00:53:31.100
I've been practicing here all night.

00:53:32.860 --> 00:53:33.800
I quit the game, Molly.

00:53:35.670 --> 00:53:37.550
It wouldn't hurt you to wait a couple of days, Frank.

00:53:39.330 --> 00:53:40.050
I wanted to quit.

00:53:41.920 --> 00:53:42.760
I'm quitting a couple of things.

00:53:50.240 --> 00:53:50.560
Bad.

00:53:55.290 --> 00:53:55.490
Bad.

00:54:01.660 --> 00:54:02.760
You shouldn't have started again.

00:54:03.750 --> 00:54:05.630
Who knows why I started in the first place.

00:54:08.640 --> 00:54:10.400
I guess in the beginning, you do it only for kicks.

00:54:14.500 --> 00:54:15.920
You gave me my first shot for nothing.

00:54:19.040 --> 00:54:20.060
Take it or leave it alone.

00:54:21.270 --> 00:54:21.850
So I took it.

00:54:22.770 --> 00:54:23.870
Took it again and again.

