hooked 40 pound monkey on my back way to get along with a load like that is to keep leaning on the fix

00:55:12.540 --> 00:55:20.640
of the lucky ones, Molly. Kicked it and I'm not too far hooked to kick it again. I've had my last

00:55:20.640 --> 00:55:29.620
fix. I mean it. Tell me something. You think those Bobby Soxes are really good for me?

00:55:31.660 --> 00:55:34.500
You couldn't do such a hell.

00:55:38.170 --> 00:55:40.710
Yeah, maybe I'll get Sparrow a job with the orchestra.

00:55:43.850 --> 00:55:48.580
Put enough money together, I can get Zash into a real good hospital

00:55:48.580 --> 00:55:50.900
so she can walk and dance again.

00:55:54.060 --> 00:55:54.780
And then maybe...

00:57:33.230 --> 00:57:33.770
Who is it?

