What now?

00:57:37.100 --> 00:57:37.800
Just a minute.

00:57:46.270 --> 00:57:47.250
Is it your morning, Miss Machine?

00:57:47.650 --> 00:57:48.010
Frankie?

00:57:48.170 --> 00:57:49.110
Frankie, where is he?

00:57:49.440 --> 00:57:50.120
What is it?

00:57:50.180 --> 00:57:50.620
What did he do?

00:57:50.780 --> 00:57:51.400
What did he do?

00:57:51.480 --> 00:57:52.220
You know what he did.

00:57:52.380 --> 00:57:53.000
He quit.

00:57:53.280 --> 00:57:54.320
No notice, no nothing.

00:57:54.540 --> 00:57:56.260
He sends white by that misfit that he's through.

00:57:56.620 --> 00:57:57.740
I didn't take the slot myself.

00:57:58.370 --> 00:57:59.110
Where is he?

00:58:01.210 --> 00:58:02.210
He wasn't at the game?

00:58:02.530 --> 00:58:05.050
Would we be looking for him all over if he was at the game?

00:58:05.520 --> 00:58:08.440
He eats my bread. Six years he eats my bread.

00:58:08.660 --> 00:58:10.500
He gets put away, I send you money regular.

00:58:10.800 --> 00:58:11.880
He gets out, I give him his job.

00:58:12.180 --> 00:58:13.580
Shut up. What do you mean? Shut up.

00:58:13.640 --> 00:58:18.620
Shut up. You think it was easy talking fellas like Williams and Marquette up to a two-bid game like yours?

00:58:18.660 --> 00:58:19.460
Louie, Louie, I...

00:58:19.460 --> 00:58:20.440
I sold him on Frankie.

