00:58:30.280 --> 00:58:35.240
Louie, I swear, I swear, when Mark Kent and Williams come, the dealer will be there, or a player just as good.

00:58:35.360 --> 00:58:36.200
There ain't none as good.

00:58:36.860 --> 00:58:38.760
Why didn't you offer him more money, a piece of the play?

00:58:39.110 --> 00:58:40.270
From your end or mine?

00:58:40.470 --> 00:58:41.890
What's the difference, whose end?

00:58:42.090 --> 00:58:44.190
You expect me to stand here and argue about pennies?

00:58:47.130 --> 00:58:58.900
You're a musician.

00:59:00.000 --> 00:59:05.860
how does it feel well it feels like you better hang out of my arm or i go up like a balloon

00:59:05.860 --> 00:59:15.870
i'm a musician where are we going i don't know but i want to buy you something ah no gotta spend

00:59:15.870 --> 00:59:22.250
some money or i'll bust how about one of those and bring it ah thank you maybe a color tv set

