I wonder what he does for living.

00:59:40.130 --> 00:59:43.400
Must make a nice dollar.

00:59:44.320 --> 00:59:46.490
Look the way he dresses you, kitchen like that.

00:59:47.090 --> 00:59:48.450
I notice he don't help her none, though.

00:59:49.180 --> 00:59:50.380
I bet he never even married the girl.

00:59:50.560 --> 00:59:52.160
Look at that, she ain't even wearing a ring on her finger.

00:59:53.030 --> 00:59:54.370
Takes it off when she cooks, maybe.

00:59:55.660 --> 00:59:57.250
Then he's tired after a hard day's work.

00:59:58.300 --> 00:59:59.960
All right, so let him sit there, but at least...

01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:01.400
He could talk to her once in a while.

01:00:01.620 --> 01:00:03.940
He doesn't have to sit there with his nose buried in a magazine.

01:00:04.270 --> 01:00:05.150
I would talk to her.

01:00:05.720 --> 01:00:06.520
What would you say?

01:00:08.060 --> 01:00:09.100
Oh, I'd say, how you been?

01:00:09.560 --> 01:00:10.420
How did it go today?

01:00:10.770 --> 01:00:11.530
What's for supper?

01:00:11.840 --> 01:00:12.200
Steak.

01:00:12.620 --> 01:00:14.620
Steak's for supper, and everything went fine today.

01:00:15.120 --> 01:00:15.480
Steak?

01:00:15.700 --> 01:00:15.880
Good.

01:00:16.950 --> 01:00:19.290
Now, how about you and me stepping out tonight after we eat?

01:00:20.400 --> 01:00:21.480
Why don't we just stay home?

01:00:22.190 --> 01:00:22.890
Turn on some music.

01:00:24.280 --> 01:00:26.820
Yeah, I like that better.

01:00:28.700 --> 01:00:29.900
Stay home and turn on some music.

01:00:32.430 --> 01:00:33.270
Maybe she was Monday already.

01:00:38.000 --> 01:00:38.580
Hi, Zasch.

01:00:38.860 --> 01:00:39.660
Where you been?

01:00:40.780 --> 01:00:42.100
Zaschko's here, he said you quit him.

01:00:42.300 --> 01:00:42.820
Where you been?

01:00:43.000 --> 01:00:43.200
Look.

01:00:43.440 --> 01:00:44.240
Why'd you quit him?

01:00:44.480 --> 01:00:45.560
I get a tryout on Monday.

